{'symbol': 'EXPD', 'date': '2019-11-04 22:30:00', 'title': 'EXPEDITORS INTERNATIONAL OF WASHINGTON, INC. ANNOUNCES SEMI-ANNUAL CASH DIVIDEND, PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 16, 2019', 'text': 'EXPEDITORS INTERNATIONAL OF WASHINGTON, INC. ANNOUNCED THAT ON NOVEMBER 4, 2019, ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A SEMI-ANNUAL CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.50 PER SHARE, PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 16, 2019 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF DECEMBER 2, 2019.'}